{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>And he shall not go out of the sanctuary.</b> The translators [said] after the dead, and this is correct. Some say during the seven days of ordination, but this is impossible, for it already stated 'and filled his hand.' It is also possible that he shall not go out of the sanctuary except for a matter of commandment."], :book :leviticus, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 21, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:11:32.762397337Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}